      "title": "PERSONAL INFORMATION",
      "enforcement_date": "",
      "content": "[별지 제5호서식]\n\n(앞쪽)\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\nPERSONAL INFORMATION                                            ┃[PHOTO]                   ┃\n┃(3㎝×4㎝)                ┃\n* FOR OFFICIAL USE ONLY                                         ┃                          ┃\n┏━━━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━┯━━━━━┯━━━━━━┩                          ┃\n┃FULL NAME         │Last/First/Middle │DATE OF   │Month/Day/Year│                          ┃\n┃                  │                  │BIRTH     │            │                          ┃\n┠─────────┼─────────┼─────┼──────┤                          ┃\n┃NATIONALITY       │                  │PLACE OF  │City/Country│                          ┃\n┃(include any      │                  │ BIRTH    │            │                          ┃\n┃dual nationality) │                  │          │            │                          ┃\n┠─────────┼─────────┼─────┼──────┴─────────────┨\n┃FOREIGNER         │                  │DATE&     │Month/Day/Year       City/Country       ┃\n┃REGISTRATION      │                  │PLACE YOU │                                        ┃\n┃NUMBER            │                  │ENTERED   │                                        ┃\n┃                  │                  │KOREA     │                                        ┃\n┠─────────┼─────────┴─────┴┬──────┬────────────┨\n┃ADDRESS           │                                │GENDER      │                        ┃\n┠─────────┼─────────┬──────┼──────┼────────────┨\n┃WORK PLACE        │                  │JOB/POSITION│            │                        ┃\n┠─────────┼─────────┴──────┴──────┴────────────┨\n┃TELEPHONE         │ HOME:                  WORK:                  MOBILE:                  ┃\n┃NUMBERS           │                                                                        ┃\n┃(Include Area     │                                                                        ┃\n┃code)             │                                                                        ┃\n┠─────────┼────┬───────┬────┬──────┬───────────┨\n┃EDUCATION         │NAME OF │DATES         │DEGREE/ │GRADUATION  │LOCATION              ┃\n┃                  │SCHOOL  │ATTENDED      │MAJOR   │DATE        │(Address &            ┃\n┃                  │        │(MM/YY-MM/YY) │        │(MM/YY)     │City/Country)         ┃\n┃                  ├────┼───────┼────┼──────┼───────────┨\n┃                  │        │              │        │            │                      ┃\n┃                  ├────┼───────┼────┼──────┼───────────┨\n┃                  │        │              │        │            │                      ┃\n┃                  ├────┼───────┼────┼──────┼───────────┨\n┃                  │        │              │        │            │                      ┃\n┃                  ├────┼───────┼────┼──────┼───────────┨\n┃                  │        │              │        │            │                      ┃\n┃                  ├────┼───────┼────┼──────┼───────────┨\n┃                  │        │              │        │            │                      ┃\n┃                  ├────┼───────┼────┼──────┼───────────┨\n┃                  │        │              │        │            │                      ┃\n┃                  ├────┼───────┼────┼──────┼───────────┨\n┃                  │        │              │        │            │                      ┃\n┗━━━━━━━━━┷━━━━┷━━━━━━━┷━━━━┷━━━━━━┷━━━━━━━━━━━┛\n┏━━━━━━━┯━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━━┓\n┃EMPLOYMENT    │EMPLOYER/ │DATES EMPLOYED                  │POSITION            │LOCATION            ┃\n┃HISTORY       │REFERENCE │(MM/YY-MM/YY)                   │                    │(Address &          ┃\n┃              │          │                                │                    │City/Country)       ┃\n┃              ├─────┼────────────────┼──────────┼──────────┨\n┃              │          │                                │                    │                    ┃\n┃              ├─────┼────────────────┼──────────┼──────────┨\n┃              │          │                                │                    │                    ┃\n┃              ├─────┼────────────────┼──────────┼──────────┨\n┃              │          │                                │                    │                    ┃\n┃              ├─────┼────────────────┼──────────┼──────────┨\n┃              │          │                                │                    │                    ┃\n┠───────┼────┬┴────────┬───────┼──────────┼──────────┨\n┃FAMILY        │RELATION│FULL NAME         │DATE OF       │OCCUPATION          │PHONE               ┃\n┃INFORMATION   │        │Last/First/Middle │BIRTH         │                    │NUMBER              ┃\n┃              ├────┼─────────┼───────┼──────────┼──────────┨\n┃              │        │                  │              │                    │                    ┃\n┃              ├────┼─────────┼───────┼──────────┼──────────┨\n┃              │        │                  │              │                    │                    ┃\n┃              ├────┼─────────┼───────┼──────────┼──────────┨\n┃              │        │                  │              │                    │                    ┃\n┃              ├────┼─────────┼───────┼──────────┼──────────┨\n┃              │        │                  │              │                    │                    ┃\n┠───────┼────┼─────────┼───────┼─────┬────┼──────────┨\n┃RELATIVES     │RELATION│FULL NAME         │DATES KNOWN   │OCCUPATION│POSITION│PHONE               ┃\n┃&             │        │Last/First/Middle │(MM/YY-MM/YY) │          │        │NUMBER              ┃\n┃ACQUAINTANCES ├────┼─────────┼───────┼─────┼────┼──────────┨\n┃IN KOREA      │        │                  │              │          │        │                    ┃\n┃              ├────┼─────────┼───────┼─────┼────┼──────────┨\n┃              │        │                  │              │          │        │                    ┃\n┃              ├────┼─────────┼───────┼─────┼────┼──────────┨\n┃              │        │                  │              │          │        │                    ┃\n┠───────┴────┴─────────┴───────┴─────┴────┴──────────┨\n┃I understand that the information provided in this form may be submitted for verification against the   ┃\n┃criminal records and credit agencies in accordance with the security clearance policy. I declare that   ┃\n┃the information I have provided is true and complete to the best of my knowledge and belief. I          ┃\n┃understand that any false statement or deliberate omission in the information I have given in this form ┃\n┃may disqualify me from employment or make me liable to disciplinary action which may include dismissal. ┃\n┃                                                                                                        ┃\n┃     DATE :                                                                                             ┃\n┃          SIGNATURE :                                                                                   ┃\n┃                                                                                                        ┃\n┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛",
